diff --git a/patches/README.md b/patches/README.md
index 6441dce..5420210 100644
--- a/patches/README.md
+++ b/patches/README.md
@@ -311,3 +311,4 @@ Reserved:
   LineageOS. 0176 completes My Sable's rows: Dual apps (opens Settings > Apps, where Cloned apps lives) and a Battery health state read from the sticky battery broadcast, with their text in every language file (English for now).
   0177 fits Sable Keyboard to the Q25's 411 dp square screen: key rows are 40 to 52 dp, so the four rows take at most 45% of the window (40 dp on the Q25, 52 dp on tall phones), and no navigation bar space is reserved when no navigation bar shows.
   0178 makes Cosgrove the phone's assistant and lets him text: an ACTION_ASSIST entry (holding the BlackBerry key opens him), `text Name: message` typed or the model's `SEND_SMS name :: message` line prepares a text, the name is found in contacts on the phone, and the text is sent from the default SIM only after the owner presses Send on the confirm card (Open in Messages and Cancel beside it). New lines are in every language file (English for now). ButlerTest covers the parsing.
+  0179 makes expanded Quick Settings on the Q25 a one-column list (owner decision 2026-11-12): SableQuickSettingsLayout for square keyboard phones is two columns with every default tile large, so each row is one tile; the compact row of four is unchanged.
diff --git a/sable-src/src/android/shared/sabledesign/src/main/java/org/sableos/design/SableSystemTokens.kt b/sable-src/src/android/shared/sabledesign/src/main/java/org/sableos/design/SableSystemTokens.kt
